<title>NORWAY: Norsk Hydro H197 pre-tax falls 4.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Norsk Hydro H197 pre-tax falls 4.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>				   (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>  Operating income		 48,291    vs	 42,948</p>
<p>  Operating result		  5,975    vs	  5,749</p>
<p>  Pre-tax profits		   5,866    vs	  6,141</p>
<p>  Net profits			 3,036    vs	  3,282</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian industrial giant is Norsk Hydro ASA. A Reuter poll of nine analysts forecast a first half operating result of 6.07 billion crowns and pre-tax profits of 6.09 billion crowns.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
